§ `ss 2, 2A, 5`

#ASSERT `cess is payable on the transaction` `a hotel room booked by a tourist during the event`
#ASSERT `cess is payable on the transaction` `a room booked by a local for a wedding`
#ASSERT `cess is payable on the transaction` `a cancelled booking never used`
#ASSERT `cess is payable on the transaction` `a booking by a business that closed mid-period`
#ASSERT NOT `cess is payable on the transaction` `a booking outside the taxable period`
#ASSERT NOT `cess is payable on the transaction` `a transaction the order does not prescribe`
#ASSERT NOT `cess is payable on the transaction` `a ticket sold by a statutory board`
#ASSERT NOT `cess is payable on the transaction` `a one-off private sale outside any business`

#ASSERT `the cess on gross receipts` 1090 90 10 EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `the cess on gross receipts` 3270 270 4 EQUALS 120

